; The fixture ledger plus logged balances, which is what gives it a net-worth domain. A ledger of its
; own because the API tests need `ledger/` to start with none: several log one balance and assert it is
; the only snapshot. Everything but the balances is included from there rather than copied.
include "../ledger/accounts.beancount"
include "../ledger/spending.beancount"
include "../ledger/income.beancount"
include "balances.beancount"
